WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.350
Luke holds heavy Flash Knuckle during the approach.

2
00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:01.850
Ryu parries the held heavy Flash Knuckle.

3
00:00:01.850 --> 00:00:02.200
Luke backs away as Ryu attempts a throw.

4
00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:03.000
Standing heavy punch punishes Ryu’s throw whiff.

5
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.050
Perfect medium Flash Knuckle launches Ryu.

6
00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:05.150
Perfect light Flash Knuckle continues the punish.

7
00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:07.450
Heavy Flash Knuckle completes the conversion.
